          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Append the segments overlapping bounds to out. Called once per frame with the region the visible lights actually reach, so a source that can narrow its search by region should. Reporting more than bounds covers is allowed and only costs work; reporting less than it covers leaks light. bounds is valid for the duration of the call and is reused afterwards."
